{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10035","headline":"感寓二首 一 · 梁德裕","name":"感寓二首 一","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"彩云呈瑞质，五色发人寰。\n独作龙虎状，孤飞天地间。\n隐隐临北极，峨峨象南山。\n恨在帝乡外，不逢枝叶攀。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"梁德裕","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_10035.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10035","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}